<title>USA: US Treasuries off session lows going into close.</title>
<headline>US Treasuries off session lows going into close.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US Treasuries were off session lows going into Thursday close</p>
<p>*Volume slows from earlier hectic levels</p>
<p>*Trading volume exceeds $100 billion two consecutive sessions for</p>
<p>the first time in more than a year, GovPX says</p>
<p>*Greenspan comments seen keeping downward bias</p>
